In this role, you will be responsible for market planning, developing synergies across multiple markets, building publisher relationships, and engaging in business conversations with clients in the media and beyond. We are seeking someone with regional experience in an agency, with a strong focus on brand and performance planning, along with expertise in stakeholder management. &nbsp;

&nbsp;

Reporting of the Role &nbsp;

This role reports to: Group Head Connection Planning &nbsp;

&nbsp;

3 Best Things About the Job &nbsp;

• Working with a client that is a leader in the sector and gaining exposure to best practices. &nbsp;

• Being part of an innovative and fast-paced agency and working closely with passionate people. &nbsp;

• Collaborating with the team on strategizing a media and communications roadmap that not only meets client requirements but also exceeds them, delivering client success. &nbsp;

&nbsp;

Responsibilities of the Role &nbsp;

• Proactively plan and implement digital development and growth for the client. &nbsp;

• Support key functions, including but not limited to Strategy, Media Planning, and Reporting. &nbsp;

• Develop strategy and digital channel recommendations to ensure delivery against set targets. &nbsp;

• Work with people across markets to address client briefs and contribute to building strategic responses. &nbsp;

